First, a quick clarification on **Rogo AI** (rogo.ai):  
Rogo is **not** an AI monitoring or observability platform. It is a **finance-native generative AI / agent platform** built for investment banking, private equity, and research workflows (comps, memos, models, diligence, etc.). It emphasizes security, auditability, citations, single-tenant options, and governance features suitable for regulated finance firms (clients include firms like Nomura, Jefferies, Lazard, etc.).

