### 1. Fiddler AI
**Best for**: Regulated financial institutions needing deep observability + explainability + runtime guardrails for both traditional ML and GenAI/agents.

**Key Capabilities & Features**:
- Unified monitoring for predictive ML (credit, fraud, AML) and generative AI / agents
- **LLM-specific**: Hallucination detection, faithfulness, toxicity, PII/PHI leakage, prompt injection/jailbreak detection
- **Fiddler Trust / Centor Models**: In-environment scoring (no external API calls, <100ms latency) for safety and quality
- Drift detection, data quality, performance metrics
- Strong **Explainable AI** (Slice & Explain, SHAP, 3D UMAP visualization)
- Fairness & bias monitoring
- Real-time **Guardrails** that can block or moderate unsafe outputs
- Custom metrics and business KPI linking
- Automated MRM / GRC report generation
- Agent hierarchy visibility (application → session → agent → spans)
- Strong finance use cases: lending decisions, trading agents, fraud, customer chatbots, underwriting

**Finance Strength**: Dedicated Financial Services data sheet and multiple large bank case studies. Excellent for audit-ready evidence and compliance.

