### 2. Arize AI (AX + Phoenix)
**Best for**: Real-time drift detection, performance tracing, and agent observability — popular with credit unions, fintechs, and engineering-led bank teams.

**Key Capabilities & Features**:
- OTel-native tracing for LLMs and multi-step agents
- Real-time drift (feature, prediction, embedding)
- Performance monitoring (accuracy, false positive/negative rates critical for lending/fraud)
- Bias / fairness tracing
- Online and offline evaluations (LLM-as-a-Judge)
- Root-cause analysis and cohort slicing
- Guardrails (input/output filtering, re-ask, block)
- Production dashboards + threshold-based alerts
- Phoenix (open-source) for self-hosted / sovereign deployments
- Strong in credit decisioning, fraud detection, and lending model monitoring

**Finance Strength**: Proven with America First Credit Union and other financial institutions; good for high-volume production monitoring.

